-- Day-by-day lineups for 9 festivals in Belgium, the Netherlands and Croatia.
-- Artist names only -- stage and time are null so the app's artist search works.
--
-- Five of these already had a lineup stored. This file replaces them because it
-- is both richer and better formatted: the stored Alcatraz lineup was entirely
-- in capitals (111 names), and the stored Lowlands rows carried two errors this
-- file corrects ('This Must Be the Pace' -> 'Place', 'sor' -> 'SOR').
-- Crowbar (Alcatraz, 7 Aug) and anaiis (Lowlands, 23 Aug) appear only in the
-- stored data, so they are carried over rather than dropped.
--
-- Appelpop is deliberately absent: its stored lineup is identical to this file.

update festival_editions e set
  program = v.program,
  source = 'manual',
  updated_at = now()
